---
export const prerender = true

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Dexic"
  description="How Dexic collects, uses, and protects your personal data across our website and our products, including Woofy, Starly, Blood Finder, and any future products."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span>Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="h-hero hero-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        How we collect, use, and protect your personal data across the Dexic website and our products, including
        Woofy, Starly, Blood Finder, and any future products.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy ("<strong>Privacy Policy</strong>") applies to the collection and processing of
          personal data ("<strong>Personal Data</strong>") by <strong>Dexic</strong> ("Dexic", "we", "us", "our") in
          connection with our website (dexic.tech) and our mobile applications, including <strong>Woofy</strong>,
          <strong>Starly</strong>, <strong>Blood Finder</strong>, and any future products we release (collectively,
          the "Services"). This Privacy Policy will help you understand how we collect and use your Personal Data
          and what we do with it.
        </p>
        <p>
          By visiting our website, using our apps, and/or purchasing something from us, you agree to us handling
          your Personal Data in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Personal Data That We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Personal Data includes any information about an individual from which that person can be identified. It
          does not include Personal Data where the identity has been removed (anonymous data, e.g. your IP address).
        </p>
        <p>Information you may provide us through our website and apps includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact data</strong>, such as your first and last name, email address, billing address, shipping
            address and phone number.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Profile data</strong>, such as the username and password you set to create an account with us on
            Woofy, Starly, Blood Finder, or our website.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Communications</strong> that we exchange with you, including when you contact us with questions
            or feedback, through the website, email, social media (including Facebook, Instagram and WhatsApp), or
            in-app support.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Transactional data</strong>, such as information relating to or needed to complete your orders or
            in-app purchases, including order numbers and transaction history.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>App usage and device data</strong>, such as device type, operating system, unique device
            identifiers, push notification tokens, and crash or diagnostic logs collected through Woofy, Starly, or
            Blood Finder.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Location data</strong>, where you grant permission — for example, to show nearby animal rescue
            reports in Woofy or connect you with nearby donors in Blood Finder.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Camera, microphone and media data</strong>, where you grant permission — for example, to upload
            photos of an animal in need in Woofy, or to host or join a live session in Starly.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Personal Data</h2>
        <p>We use your Personal Data for the following:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide you with the required services and/or products that you order from our website or apps.</li>
          <li>Respond to your questions or requests.</li>
          <li>Improve our operations, website and apps.</li>
          <li>Prevent, detect and manage risk against fraud and illegal activities.</li>
          <li>Comply with our financial, regulatory and other legal obligations.</li>
          <li>Target advertisements, newsletters and service updates.</li>
          <li>Improve content and the layout of our website and apps.</li>
          <li>Resolve disputes that may arise.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Who Do We Share Your Personal Data With?</h2>
        <p>
          To enable us to provide our services to you, we may share your information with trusted third parties,
          including financial institutions, payment processors and verification services, as well as any third
          parties you have directly authorized to receive your Personal Data, including courier service providers.
        </p>
        <p>
          We share Personal Data with third-party business partners when necessary to provide our products and/or
          services. Examples of such third parties include banks and payment method providers (such as credit card
          networks and mobile wallets) when we provide payment processing services, as well as cloud hosting,
          analytics, and push-notification providers that support Woofy, Starly and Blood Finder.
        </p>

        <h2>5. How We Protect Your Personal Data</h2>
        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to ensure a level of security appropriate to the risk associated with the
          processing of Personal Data. We implement access control measures (physical and virtual), security
          protocols, policies and standards to ensure that our security infrastructure complies with reasonable
          industry standards. We maintain organizational, technical and administrative measures designed to protect
          Personal Data within our organization against unauthorized access, destruction, loss, alteration or
          misuse.
        </p>
        <p>
          We have also put in place procedures to deal with any suspected Personal Data breach and will notify you
          and any applicable regulator of a breach where we are legally required to do so.
        </p>

        <h2>6. How Long Do We Store Your Information?</h2>
        <p>
          We will only retain your Personal Data for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes we collected it
          for, including satisfying any legal, regulatory, accounting or reporting requirements, or for the
          establishment or defence of legal claims.
        </p>
        <p>
          We will retain your information for as long as your account with us (including your Woofy, Starly, or
          Blood Finder account) is active, or as needed to provide you with our services, comply with our legal and
          statutory obligations, or verify your information with a financial institution.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our Services are not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect Personal
          Data from children under 13. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided us with Personal Data,
          we will take steps to delete such information.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Subject to applicable law, you may have the right to access, correct, update, or request deletion of your
          Personal Data. You may also have the right to withdraw consent where we rely on your consent to process
          your Personal Data (for example, location, camera or microphone permissions in our apps), which you can
          generally manage through your device settings. To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using
          the details below.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for other
          operational, legal or regulatory reasons. We will post any changes on this page and, where appropriate,
          notify you through our website or apps.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your Personal Data, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@dexic.tech">contact@dexic.tech</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +92 305 8688 545</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> Islamabad, Pakistan</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 32px 80px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 52px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 24px 60px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }
</style>
